nginx-web bundles an independently running NGINX Open Source binary.

NGINX version: 1.30.4 (stable)

ARM64 and AMD64 package provenance:
- Source archive: https://nginx.org/download/nginx-1.30.4.tar.gz
- Official source SHA-256: 4261dc90e9e47c1c4041276e9aaa3d48ebe2e664f728e14fa95ae6c67d57a08b
- Binary build: compiled for Linux ARM64 or AMD64 in an Alpine container.
- No third-party NGINX modules are added.

nginx-web does not modify, load, stop, or reload the fnOS system NGINX instance.
